                <div class="heading">
                    <h4>See why people choose Lanxers </h4>
                    <p>Hear from employers who are finding skilled professionals and building stronger teams through Lanxers.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="swiper testimonialSwiper">
                    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>The AI shortlisting took our pile of 40-odd resumes down to six worth calling, and we made an offer inside ten days. I was skeptical about a genuinely free hiring platform, but it turns out the consultancy team behind it is how they make it work, not by quietly charging us.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Suresh Nair</h5>
                                        <p>Operations Head</p>
                                        <p>Pune</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We were hiring our first sales person and honestly didn't know how many applications we'd get. The profiles helped us understand who was actually worth interviewing before we started calling people.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Aman Gupta</h5>
                                        <p>Co-founder</p>
                                        <p>Gurugram</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>I liked that we could put the actual requirements of the role upfront. We weren't just looking at generic resumes coming in from everywhere.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Neha Kulkarni</h5>
                                        <p>HR Manager</p>
                                        <p>Pune</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We needed a senior designer who could work independently. A lot of applicants had the right job title but not the right kind of experience. Looking through their previous work helped us narrow it down.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Rohan Mehra</h5>
                                        <p>Founder</p>
                                        <p>Mumbai</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>Our last few hires came through referrals, but that obviously doesn't scale forever. Lanxers gave us another channel when we had an open position and wanted to see who was out there.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Kunal Shah</h5>
                                        <p>Director</p>
                                        <p>Ahmedabad</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>I was hiring for an accountant who could also handle our GST work. Being able to see the candidate's background before scheduling an interview saved us quite a bit of back and forth.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Megha Joshi</h5>
                                        <p>Business Owner</p>
                                        <p>Surat</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="swiper testimonialSwiper2">
                    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We were expanding into a second city and needed people on the ground fairly quickly. The applications gave us a much wider pool than our usual local references.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Siddharth Menon</h5>
                                        <p>Business Head</p>
                                        <p>Chennai</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>The thing I appreciated was having the candidate information in one place. I could go through the profile, make a shortlist, and then discuss it with my co-founder.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Ishita Kapoor</h5>
                                        <p>Co-founder</p>
                                        <p>Bengaluru</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We weren't looking for someone with ten different certifications. We needed someone who had actually done the work before. The profiles made it easier to look at that part.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Rajeev Sethi</h5>
                                        <p>Operations Director</p>
                                        <p>Ludhiana</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
