                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We wanted a marketing intern who could actually contribute, not just spend the summer doing admin work. We ended up finding someone who already had a few interesting projects under her belt.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Sahil Agarwal</h5>
                                        <p>Founder, Food Startup,</p>
                                        <p>Delhi</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>For internships, I care more about curiosity and what someone has tried than having a long resume. The profiles gave us enough to get a sense of that.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Ritu Nair</h5>
                                        <p>Marketing Manager, EdTech Company,</p>
                                        <p>Bengaluru</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We needed two interns for our design team before the next semester started. Having the applications in one place made it much easier to compare them.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Harsh Vora</h5>
                                        <p>Creative Lead, Advertising Agency,</p>
                                        <p>Mumbai</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>One candidate had no professional experience but had built three projects on her own. That was actually more interesting to us than someone with a long list of courses.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Ayesha Khan</h5>
                                        <p>Product Lead, Software Company,</p>
                                        <p>Hyderabad</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" alt="b80a35c81dbfb4dceca986ae9c6d9b54e4e19152.png" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We run a small company and don't have the bandwidth to train someone from absolute zero. We were looking for students who already had some basic skills and wanted to learn further.</p>
