                <div class="swiper testimonialSwiper">
                    <div class="swiper-wrapper">
                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>Posted a brief for a reels editor on a Tuesday night, had three solid proposals by Thursday morning. What actually sold me was the payment - I paid the freelancer exactly what we agreed on, nothing skimmed off the top for the platform.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Rhea Kapoor</h5>
                                        <p>Founder, D2C Skincare Brand</p>
                                        <p>Mumbai</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/testimonial-1.png" alt="Rhea Kapoor" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>Honestly went in expecting the usual, great until you try to actually message someone, then suddenly there's a paywall. Wasn't the case here. Found a content writer and an SEO freelancer for the same campaign, both reachable from day one, no credits or 'unlock this profile' nonsense.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Meenal Joshi</h5>
                                        <p>Marketing Lead, Ed-Tech Company</p>
                                        <p>Bengaluru</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/testimonial-1.png" alt="Meenal Joshi" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>Not exactly a tech guy, so I liked that it didn't feel complicated. Needed someone to redo our menu design and shop branding, found a designer, and we just talked, sorted the whole thing over chat in about a week.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Devraj Singh</h5>
                                        <p>Owner, Bakery Chain</p>
                                        <p>Chandigarh</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/testimonial-1.png" alt="Devraj Singh" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We had a product launch coming up and needed someone for the landing page pretty quickly. Got a few applications that were actually relevant instead of 50 people applying for everything. Ended up going with a designer whose previous work was very close to what we needed.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Ankit Bansal</h5>
                                        <p>Co-founder, SaaS Startup</p>
                                        <p>Noida</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="image">
                                        <img src="./assets/images/testimonial-1.png" alt="Ankit Bansal" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>I run a fairly small agency, so I don't always have people with every skill in-house. Lanxers has been useful for filling those gaps when a client asks for something outside our usual work.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
                                        <h5>Shreya Menon</h5>
                                        <p>Agency Owner</p>
                                        <p>Kochi</p>
                                    </div>
