                                        <img src="./assets/images/testimonial-1.png" alt="Shreya Menon" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>Needed a photographer and editor for a batch of product shoots. What helped was being able to see their previous work before deciding. For creative work, that tells you a lot more than a CV does.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
                                    <div class="name">
