                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>Usually when we need a freelancer, someone on the team has to spend half a day asking around for recommendations. Posting the requirement on Lanxers gave us another option, especially when we didn't already have someone in mind.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
