                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>I needed a video editor for YouTube, not a full-time person. The project was pretty straightforward and I didn't want to go through a long hiring process. Found someone who understood the brief and got started within the week.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
