                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>The portfolio was honestly the deciding factor. Two people looked good on paper, but one had work much closer to our style. Made the decision a lot easier.</p>
