                                        <img src="./assets/images/testimonial-1.png" alt="Tanvi Shah" />
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="swiper-slide">
                            <div class="single">
                                <div class="descripition">
                                    <p>We're a startup, so requirements change all the time. Sometimes we need a developer for two weeks, sometimes a designer for a particular launch. Having a place to put those requirements out there is useful.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="user">
